OL,3,GNEWSABudget 2026: Calls to reduce fuel
OL,4,Acosts and help the high street
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chancellor John Healey has promised
OL,7,Fto give people "breathing space" from
OL,8,Fcost of living pressures in his first
OL,9,FBudget.
OL,11,FIn East Grinstead in West Sussex,
OL,12,Fseveral people told the BBC they were
OL,13,Ffeeling squeezed, ahead of Wednesday's
OL,14,Fannouncement.
OL,16,FTaxi driver Stephen Payne said the cost
OL,17,Fof diesel was putting pressure on his
OL,18,Fincome as it was "going up every day".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
