OL,3,GNEWSABudget 2026: Calls to reduce fuel
OL,4,Acosts and help the high street
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he is now having to do "four or
OL,7,Ffive big jobs" to cover the cost of
OL,8,Ffuel before he earns any profit, while
OL,9,Fthe cost of his everyday essentials
OL,10,Fwere also going up.
